  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">아래의 탐구활동은&#160;<br>&#39;관찰력&#39; 및<br>&#39;과학탐구과정&#39;을<br>향상시킬 수 있는 좋은 방법이어서 소개합니다.<br>&#160;<br>1. 보드마커를 1개씩 주고,&#160; 관찰하면서<br>&#160; &#160;단어,<br>&#160; &#160;동사,<br>&#160; &#160;질문을 적어주세요.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa8d56fb2f0744fc078d78db259386bdd2715104\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"400\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fa8d56fb2f0744fc078d78db259386bdd2715104\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"901\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b2525b100f106cc5c1ae8bc73d6490d100b0b14\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b2525b100f106cc5c1ae8bc73d6490d100b0b14\" data-origin-width=\"1305\" data-origin-height=\"862\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>3. 궁금한 점 하나를 탐구합니다.<br>&#160;1) 나의 의문 : 빨간 마개와는 달리,<br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 신제품 검은 마개에는 왜 구멍이 있을까?&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f9ce0ea6434edd6e7a8b6034db4926bf29ae40e\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"273\" height=\"154\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f9ce0ea6434edd6e7a8b6034db4926bf29ae40e\" data-origin-width=\"1152\" data-origin-height=\"860\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;2) 나의 가설1 : 구멍을 통해 공기의 이동이 가능하여 마개를 쉽게 끼우거나 뺄 수 있다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a49c3966d47ba2f42f8ef4b3c37ef5d66f2f4291\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"300\" height=\"312\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a49c3966d47ba2f42f8ef4b3c37ef5d66f2f4291\" data-origin-width=\"539\" data-origin-height=\"561\"></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&#160;<br>&#160;3) 가설2 : ________________________________________<br>&#160;<br>&#160;4) 가설3 : ________________________________________<br>&#160;<br><b>선생님의 가설은 무엇인가요?</b><br><b>그리고 그것을 어떻게 검증할 수 있을까요?</b><br>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160;<br>&#160; &#160; &#160;<br>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
